WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.710
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which correctly shows

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.643
that the bag belongs to Kojo?

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:12.442
The answer is: Kojo’s bag. The apostrophe plus s shows ownership by Kojo.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:18.332
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Choose the sentence with

00:00:18.332 --> 00:00:19.342
the correct possessive.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.552
The answer is: Ama’s book is new.. Ama’s means the book belongs to Ama.
